{'symbol': 'CBRE', 'date': '2023-04-11 09:05:00', 'title': 'CROFT YOUNG TO JOIN CBRE AS CHIEF INVESTMENT OFFICER', 'text': "DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CBRE GROUP, INC. (NYSE:CBRE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CROFT YOUNG, A SENIOR INVESTMENT BANKER, WILL JOIN THE COMPANY AS CHIEF INVESTMENT OFFICER. WHEN HE JOINS CBRE IN JULY, THE COMPANY'S GLOBAL CORPORATE DEVELOPMENT AND STRATEGY TEAMS WILL REPORT TO MR. YOUNG. CBRE HAS ENHANCED ITS MARKET POSITION OVER THE LAST SEVERAL YEARS THROUGH A COMBINATION OF ORGANIC GROWTH AND MERGERS AND ACQUISITIONS (M&A). WITH $4."}